			"text": " Hey, welcome to Mariners Church. I'm so glad you were with us today. If we haven't met, my name is Eric. I'm the senior pastor here. You just saw the trailer for a teaching series that we launched in three weeks. We're going to study the book of Revelation. This book is fascinated people for centuries. For some people, it's scary, like the sci-fi section of the Bible. For others, it's confusing. But really, it shouldn't be either one of those. The book of Revelation is about comfort and hope because we see that Jesus is in charge of everything.",
